# 8. What Happened After the Email Was Opened

The malicious email appeared in the vulnerable Outlook environment.

After the victim clicked:

```text
Click me
```

the crafted Moniker Link caused the Windows system to attempt interaction with the remote resource.

A simplified representation is:

```text
Malicious Email
      ↓
Outlook
      ↓
Crafted Moniker Link
      ↓
Remote Resource Access
      ↓
SMB Authentication
      ↓
Responder
      ↓
Authentication Data Observed
```

The important point is that the attack is **not simply**:

```text
Click link
     ↓
Password stolen
```

There are multiple steps between the click and the authentication data being observed.

